WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.480
Ever wondered about the&nbsp;
deepest desires of SCP-076-2,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.200
the terrifying, immortal warrior known as Able?

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.800
SCP Foundation researchers took photos&nbsp;
of Able with SCP-978, the Desire Camera,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.800
while he rested in his black sarcophagus.&nbsp;
The following was the result.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.160
“Able tending to a herd of&nbsp;
pigs in a pastoral landscape,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.520
while a large city is consumed&nbsp;
by flames in the background.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:28.400
Closer inspection revealed that the pigs&nbsp;
were consuming the remains of SCP-073.”

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.280
Well, at least half of that was surprising…

